   "fieldname": "typst_help",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "label": "Typst Help",
   "options": "<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\">\n  <div>\n    <strong>Typst Preamble</strong>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;\">Global setup that runs before any document content. Use it for page settings, fonts, and shared styles.</p>\n    <pre style=\"margin:8px 0 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><code>#set text(font: \"Inter 18pt\", size: 11pt)\n#set table(stroke: 0.25pt, inset: 8pt)\n#set grid(inset: 8pt)</code></pre>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <strong>Document Header</strong>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;\">This field defines <code>header_block</code>. It is injected into <code>#set page(header: header_block)</code>.</p>\n    <pre style=\"margin:8px 0 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><code>#set page(header-ascent: 0em)\n#let header_block = [\n  #grid(\n    columns: (1fr, 1fr),\n    align: (left, right),\n    [#text(size: 14pt, weight: 800)[#doc.doctype]],\n    [#text(size: 18pt, red)[#doc.name]]\n  )\n  #v(1em)\n]</code></pre>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <strong>Document Footer</strong>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;\">This field defines <code>footer_block</code>. It is injected into <code>#set page(footer: footer_block)</code>.</p>\n    <pre style=\"margin:8px 0 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><code>#let footer_block = align(right + horizon)[\n  #set text(lang: \"ar\", size: 8pt)\n  #context counter(page).display(\"1 من 1\", both: true)\n]</code></pre>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <strong>Branding Layering</strong>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;\">Letterheads render in page <code>background</code>. Logos and QR codes render in <code>foreground</code>, so they sit above content and ignore margins.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
  }
